[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="PartAssembly" format=3]
; The Archivist (boss placeholder): the keeper of the cold archive, a reliquary the size of a cabinet floating
; under a great rotor, one round eye, two fins, and seven cables trailing lights like a card index. Generated from
; resources/parts/lamplighter.tres scaled by 3.2, with four more cables. Placeholder until the character pass.
; Origin at its center. Joints: X forward, Y up, Z toward the camera.

